    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Home Below is a single-player, story-driven exploration game where you play as a hermit crab exploring the ruins of a house that\u2019s been lost to the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/8dc2e373e9909367acf8841414af8f65.poster.avif?t=1749226477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/8dc2e373e9909367acf8841414af8f65.webm?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/8dc2e373e9909367acf8841414af8f65.mp4?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVESTIGATE THE HOUSE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in near-future North Wales, A Home Below is inspired by real climate stories of rising sea levels and flooding, causing entire towns to vanish underwater. As you explore the remnants of the Salt family's once-loved home, you'll piece together how they responded to this disaster, and what happened to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/a3ca5c7f9059b88e9ecf620d0061f015.poster.avif?t=1749226477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/a3ca5c7f9059b88e9ecf620d0061f015.webm?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/a3ca5c7f9059b88e9ecf620d0061f015.mp4?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVERSE THE ENVIRONMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform around large underwater rooms, drifting and floating your way further into the house, harnessing ocean currents and hitching lifts, climbing over surfaces and through cracks in the walls as you travel from room to room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/4bb66aaedc72eaa2a6a697d6ba9d8ad6.poster.avif?t=1749226477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/4bb66aaedc72eaa2a6a697d6ba9d8ad6.webm?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/4bb66aaedc72eaa2a6a697d6ba9d8ad6.mp4?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REMEMBER THE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hermit crab with the ability to change shells, putting on the Salt family\u2019s forgotten possessions allows you to see memories from the past, revealing the ghostly traces of the lives that once filled the house. Physically platform across these tableaus, providing new pathways and access to other rooms in the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/ce5b9665d17a38e59be539d4e7f0f905.poster.avif?t=1749226477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/ce5b9665d17a38e59be539d4e7f0f905.webm?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/ce5b9665d17a38e59be539d4e7f0f905.mp4?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE FRIENDS WITH SEA LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wonderful world of responsive, characterful sea creatures based on real UK species, from skittish sea urchins and friendly anemones to a scary wrasse and a curious octopus. Add to your bestiary as you explore, learning real facts about sea life and forming powerful connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/05f9ad22fc7941ae9762f8af003cf6ec.poster.avif?t=1749226477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/05f9ad22fc7941ae9762f8af003cf6ec.webm?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/05f9ad22fc7941ae9762f8af003cf6ec.mp4?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCORD COMMUNITY SERVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community server for access to our sea life research and behind the scenes development as working continues on A Home Below.<strong> Link on the right \u2192</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Home Below is a single-player, story-driven exploration game where you play as a hermit crab exploring the ruins of a house that\u2019s been lost to the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/8dc2e373e9909367acf8841414af8f65.poster.avif?t=1749226477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/8dc2e373e9909367acf8841414af8f65.webm?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/8dc2e373e9909367acf8841414af8f65.mp4?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INVESTIGATE THE HOUSE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in near-future North Wales, A Home Below is inspired by real climate stories of rising sea levels and flooding, causing entire towns to vanish underwater. As you explore the remnants of the Salt family's once-loved home, you'll piece together how they responded to this disaster, and what happened to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/a3ca5c7f9059b88e9ecf620d0061f015.poster.avif?t=1749226477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/a3ca5c7f9059b88e9ecf620d0061f015.webm?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/a3ca5c7f9059b88e9ecf620d0061f015.mp4?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVERSE THE ENVIRONMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform around large underwater rooms, drifting and floating your way further into the house, harnessing ocean currents and hitching lifts, climbing over surfaces and through cracks in the walls as you travel from room to room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/4bb66aaedc72eaa2a6a697d6ba9d8ad6.poster.avif?t=1749226477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/4bb66aaedc72eaa2a6a697d6ba9d8ad6.webm?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/4bb66aaedc72eaa2a6a697d6ba9d8ad6.mp4?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REMEMBER THE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hermit crab with the ability to change shells, putting on the Salt family\u2019s forgotten possessions allows you to see memories from the past, revealing the ghostly traces of the lives that once filled the house. Physically platform across these tableaus, providing new pathways and access to other rooms in the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/ce5b9665d17a38e59be539d4e7f0f905.poster.avif?t=1749226477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/ce5b9665d17a38e59be539d4e7f0f905.webm?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/ce5b9665d17a38e59be539d4e7f0f905.mp4?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE FRIENDS WITH SEA LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a wonderful world of responsive, characterful sea creatures based on real UK species, from skittish sea urchins and friendly anemones to a scary wrasse and a curious octopus. Add to your bestiary as you explore, learning real facts about sea life and forming powerful connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/05f9ad22fc7941ae9762f8af003cf6ec.poster.avif?t=1749226477\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/05f9ad22fc7941ae9762f8af003cf6ec.webm?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/05f9ad22fc7941ae9762f8af003cf6ec.mp4?t=1749226477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCORD COMMUNITY SERVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community server for access to our sea life research and behind the scenes development as working continues on A Home Below.<strong> Link on the right \u2192</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "In the ruins of a house that\u2019s been lost to the sea, a hermit crab goes in search of shells. Explore the secrets of each room in this third-person underwater adventure.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cThere is something truly charming about the graphic style and the ability to be playing as a little crab just exploring the ruins of civilization. I was very captivated by the demo that I played.\u201d<br>Indie Games Plus<br><br>\u201cA Home Below stands out for its unique blend of environmental storytelling, thoughtful gameplay, and serene exploration. Hermit House\u2019s passion and dedication are evident in every aspect of the game\u2019s design.\u201d<br>Gamer Social Club<br>",
